   "gap": "Supply on the handbook route a written proof of the multivariable change-of-variables formula (for a bijection T between open subsets of R^n, n>=2, with T and T^{-1} continuously differentiable: the integral over V of g equals the integral over U of g(T(x))|det DT(x)| dx for Borel g>=0), the proof dependency of Shannon's Section 20 item 8 for general nonlinear multivariate coordinate changes. At present def:p15-w02b-p15-042-coordinate-change (body lines 317-321) states that this theorem is not proved in the handbook and takes the Jacobian identity as a hypothesis, and def:p15-w02b-p15-041-cov (041 body lines 376-386) uses it as an unproved premise; the coordinate-dependence property is therefore justified only for affine, one-dimensional C^1 monotone and product coordinate changes.",
